id: high-power
name: High Power
kind: crafting
weaponType: energy
source: Core Rule
description: >
  An Energy Charge on an attack with it wagering half the Max Capacity or more. Its Area of
  Effect a Magnitude larger.
text: >
  High Power: This Weapon funnels energy into massive blasts of pure destruction.
  –Effects: Apply an Energy Charge to any Attacking Maneuver made using this Weapon with a Ki
  Wager equal to or exceeding 1/2 of your Max Capacity. Additionally, increase the Magnitude of
  any Attacking Maneuver that possesses an AoE used by this Weapon by 1 Magnitude.

---

# `$halfWager` is 1 where the Ki Wager is half the Max Capacity or more. The Charge is one more
# on the attack, held to the most an attack may carry with the rest; the Magnitude only reaches
# an attack that has an Area.
[passive]
weapon.energyCharges += $halfWager;
weapon.magnitude += 1;
